      "rationale": "Tɔgɔ Shelomo (sh-l-m) ni Shalom 'hɛrɛ' bɛ taamasiyɛn kelen la — jɔyɔrɔ ye tɔgɔ ye, o tɛ ka ɲe Bamanankan na."
